Yes, support is included but varies by plan.

- **Business/Enterprise** — a dedicated onboarding specialist is included free for the first 30 days [1].
- **Team plan** — customers get guided setup docs and email support during onboarding instead of a dedicated specialist [1].

Check [Pricing plans](https://northline.com/pricing) to see which tier includes the dedicated specialist, and for integration setup details see https://northline.com/integrations.